WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.529
Interpret moral values using what characters say, do and cause; adapt a short

00:00:04.529 --> 00:00:07.859
narrative into a clear scene with a beginning and ending.

00:00:08.700 --> 00:00:13.860
Which detail belongs in a short retelling? Answer: The central problem and how it was

00:00:13.860 --> 00:00:14.204
solved.

00:00:15.033 --> 00:00:19.669
Create a sketch about honesty or kindness, perform it and discuss a character's

00:00:19.669 --> 00:00:20.025
decision.

00:00:20.867 --> 00:00:24.365
Why it works: Important events help the retelling make sense.
